---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Signup from '../components/Signup.astro';
import Portrait from '../components/Portrait.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free AI Strategy Starter for Founders & Leaders | Pranjal Pandey" description="Start with five questions, prioritise your first workflows and avoid the mistakes that stop AI pilots becoming useful. Get the free guide and Practical AI." minimal>
  <div class="wrap campaign">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Free guide / By Pranjal Pandey</p><h1>The AI Strategy Starter for Founders & Leaders</h1><p class="lead">A free, practical guide to working out where AI actually fits in your business, from someone who builds AI systems for a living.</p>
      <ul class="guide-contents"><li>The five questions to ask before any AI project.</li><li>How to pick your first three workflows.</li><li>Why most AI pilots stall, and how to make yours stick.</li></ul>
      <Signup id="guide-email" />
      <p class="fine-print">By Pranjal Pandey: founder at 19, PhD researcher in multi-agent systems at IIT Jodhpur, founder of Taskflo AI.</p>
    </div>
    <aside aria-label="About the author"><div class="guide-title-card"><span class="mono">Practical AI / A starting point</span><h3>Choose the workflow.<br />Then the tool.</h3><div><div class="guide-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><p>AI Strategy Starter</p><p class="fine-print">For Founders & Leaders</p></div></div><Portrait /></aside>
  </div>
</Layout>
